<title>FRANCE: Renault has no comment on Belgian plant.</title>
<headline>Renault has no comment on Belgian plant.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>French carmaker Renault said on Tuesday it had no comment on the planned closure of its plant in Vilvoorde, Belgium.</p>
<p>Belgian daily Le Soir said Renault was expected to announce on Tuesday it was delaying the Vilvoorde plant, which is scheduled to close on July 31.</p>
<p>&quot;We have no comment,&quot; a Renault spokesman said.</p>
</text>
